('Objeto animado, colosal', 'Animated Object, Colossal', 'Animated Object', 'Constructo', 'Constructo colosal', 10.0, '10', '32d10+80 (256 pg)', '-3', '10 pies (2 casillas); 20 pies legs, 30 pies multiple legs, 50 pies wheels', '11 (-8 tamaño, -3 Des, +12 natural), contacto -1, desprevenido 11', '+24/+49', 'Embestida +25 cuerpo a cuerpo (4d6+13)', 'Embestida +25 cuerpo a cuerpo (4d6+13)', '30 pies/20 pies (long) 30 pies/30 pies (tall)', 'Ver texto', 'Rasgos de constructo, visión en la oscuridad 60 pies, visión en la penumbra; also ver texto', 'Fort +10, Ref +7, Vol +5', 'Fue 28, Des 4, Con Ø, Int Ø, Sab 1, Car 1', '—', '—', 'Cualquiera', 'Solitario', 'Ninguno', 'Siempre neutral', '—', '—', 'Animated objects come in all sizes, shapes, and colors. They owe their existence as creatures to spells such as animate objects or similar supernatural abilities.

