('Burro', 'Donkey', 'Donkey', 'Animal', 'Animal mediano', 0.167, '1/6', '2d8+2 (11 pg)', '+1', '30 pies (6 casillas)', '13 (+1 Des, +2 natural), contacto 11, desprevenido 12', '+1/+1', 'Mordisco +1 cuerpo a cuerpo (1d2)', 'Mordisco +1 cuerpo a cuerpo (1d2)', '5 pies/5 pies', '—', 'Visión en la penumbra, olfato', 'Fort +4, Ref +4, Vol +0', 'Fue 10, Des 13, Con 12, Int 2, Sab 11, Car 4', 'Equilibrio +3, Escuchar +3, Avistar +2', 'Vigor', 'Desiertos templados', 'Solitario', '', '', '—', '—', 'These long-eared, horselike creatures are surefooted and sturdy. The statistics presented here could also describe burros.

