 A huge, gargantuan, or colossal fiendish monstrous centipede''s natural weapons are treated as magic weapons for the purpose of overcoming damage reduction.

Smite Good (Su)
Once per day a fiendish monstrous centipede can make a normal melee attack to deal extra damage against a good foe.', 'criatura'),
